{"seq":25,"slug":"philosophy-of-information","title":"信息哲学","stage":"DONE","category":"philosophy-logic","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-information","rating":{"composite":3.81,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"信息哲学-philosophy-of-information\">信息哲学 (Philosophy of Information)</h1><p>信息哲学是研究信息的本质、范围、结构和应用的哲学学科，由 Luciano Floridi 在 21 世纪初系统确立为独立的哲学分支。它以信息概念为中心，探讨信息与现实、知识、伦理和计算的深层关系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-涵盖内容\">本 hub 涵盖内容</h2><p>本 hub 从程序员视角系统介绍信息哲学的核心框架，涵盖四个维度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章节</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>核心问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基础理论</td>\n<td>信息的本质、抽象层次、语义信息</td>\n<td>信息究竟是什么？</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>认识论</td>\n<td>信息与知识的关系、认知逻辑</td>\n<td>信息如何转化为知识？</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>伦理政治</td>\n<td>信息伦理、隐私、算法治理</td>\n<td>信息权力应如何规范？</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算哲学</td>\n<td>计算本质、信息动力学、数字本体</td>\n<td>计算与信息如何构成现实？</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"与相邻-hub-的边界\">与相邻 hub 的边界</h2><p><strong>本 hub 的独特视角</strong>：以 Floridi 的信息哲学框架（GDI、LoA、信息圈）为核心，程序员可以在此获得对信息、计算、隐私等日常概念的哲学深度理解。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"../epistemology/\">认识论</a></strong>：研究知识的来源与合理性，本 hub 的信息-知识关系章节是其信息视角的专题延伸</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"../philosophy-of-mind/\">心灵哲学</a></strong>：关注意识与意向性，本 hub 侧重信息的形式结构而非心理表征</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"../philosophy-of-technology/\">技术哲学</a></strong>：研究技术与人类的宏观关系，本 hub 聚焦信息技术的本质性问题</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"../philosophy-of-ai/\">人工智能哲学</a></strong>：关注 AI 系统的意识、道德地位，本 hub 提供其赖以运作的信息理论基础</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"../formal-logic/\">形式逻辑</a></strong>：提供形式语言工具，本 hub 的认知逻辑章节是其动态扩展</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"为什么程序员需要信息哲学\">为什么程序员需要信息哲学</h2><p>程序员每天都在操作信息——编码、传输、存储、解析——但很少追问信息的本质。Floridi 的框架揭示：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Shannon 的信息论</strong>只解决了传输效率，没有回答&quot;这条消息意味着什么&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>抽象层次方法</strong>是面向对象设计和 API 设计的哲学基础</li>\n<li><strong>算法治理</strong>的透明性争论直接关系到程序员的职业伦理责任</li>\n<li><strong>数字本体论</strong>挑战了&quot;数字只是符号&quot;的天真观点</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>Floridi, L. <em>The Philosophy of Information</em> (2011) — 系统性奠基之作</li>\n<li>Shannon, C. E. &quot;A Mathematical Theory of Communication&quot; (1948) — 信息论起点</li>\n<li>Zuboff, S. <em>The Age of Surveillance Capitalism</em> (2019) — 信息政治经济学</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础理论：信息的本质与结构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-information/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"nature-of-information","title":"信息的本质：从香农到 Floridi","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-information/foundations/nature-of-information"},{"seq":2,"slug":"levels-of-abstraction","title":"抽象层次方法：系统分析的认识论工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-information/foundations/levels-of-abstraction"},{"seq":3,"slug":"information-semantics","title":"信息语义学：意义、真值与虚假信息悖论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-information/foundations/information-semantics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"epistemology","title":"认识论：信息、知识与推理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-information/epistemology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"information-knowledge-relation","title":"信息与知识的关系：从数据到理解的跃迁","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-information/epistemology/information-knowledge-relation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"epistemic-logic-information","title":"认知逻辑与信息：知识更新的形式化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-information/epistemology/epistemic-logic-information"},{"seq":3,"slug":"information-closure-problem","title":"信息闭合问题：演绎的悖论与知识边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-information/epistemology/information-closure-problem"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"ethics-politics","title":"伦理与政治：信息权力的规范","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-information/ethics-politics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"information-ethics","title":"信息伦理学：信息圈与道德责任","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-information/ethics-politics/information-ethics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"privacy-surveillance","title":"隐私与监控：信息自决权的哲学基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-information/ethics-politics/privacy-surveillance"},{"seq":3,"slug":"algorithmic-governance","title":"算法治理：透明性、可解释性与问责制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-information/ethics-politics/algorithmic-governance"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"computation","title":"计算哲学：信息、计算与数字存在","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-information/computation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"philosophy-of-computation","title":"计算哲学：Church-Turing 论题的边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-information/computation/philosophy-of-computation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"information-dynamics","title":"信息动力学：信道理论与信息流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-information/computation/information-dynamics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-ontology","title":"数字本体论：信息结构主义与存在的信息基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-information/computation/digital-ontology"}]}]}